# 三端单工程：脚本与 CI 配置必须是 LF，否则 shell / xcodebuild / bash -n 在 macOS 与 CI 上会崩
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.ps1   text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
hvigorfile.ts   text eol=lf
hvigorw         text eol=lf

# 二进制资产不做换行处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.so  binary
*.har binary
*.apk binary
*.aar binary
*.ipa binary
*.hap binary
*.klib binary
*.jar binary
